  "title": "Capturing Opportunity: Turning Landfill Gas into Clean Energy in Chemung, NY",
  "summary": "A long-standing partnership between Casella and Chemung County is helping transform landfill gas into renewable natural gas (RNG), creating a valuable energy resource while reducing greenhouse gas emissions. Through collaboration with Waga Energy, the project captures gas generated through the natural decomposition of waste and converts it into lower-carbon energy that can be delivered to the local gas grid.",
